{
  "id": "V12",
  "title": "Unsupported gravity and a point load on a post",
  "intent": "A full-line floor load runs over two walls and over two gaps with nothing below (8–16 ft and 24–30 ft): the gap parts are reported as \"not carried\" and the gravity checks count them as excluded, not failed. A point load at x = 12 ft sits on the top of support post P-5 and goes down the post to the foundation. The walls get only the load directly above them.",
  "covers": [
    "Gravity split: over a wall / on a post / over nothing",
    "Audit note gravity_unsupported (excluded in G4 / G8)",
    "Post gravity from a point load",
    "ASCE 7-22 §2.4.1 (2) D + L and §2.4.5 (6) with live load"
  ],
  "handCalc": [
    {
      "step": 1,
      "text": "Story shear V = 4 k to two equal walls (8 ft, same nailing) → 2.00 k each; v = 0.7 × 2000 / 8 = 175.00 plf → 6\" o.c.."
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "text": "Each wall carries the load directly above it: D = 100 plf × 8 ft + 10 psf × 8 × 10 = 1.60 k → 0.80 k per end; L = 200 × 8 = 1.60 k → 0.80 k per end. N_E = 2 × 10 / 8 = ±2.50 k."
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "text": "Uplift (0.6 − 0.14S_DS)D + 0.7E: 0.46 × 0.80 − 0.7 × 2.50 = -1.382 → T = 1.382 k → HDUE3."
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "text": "Compression: (5) 1.14 × 0.80 + 0.7 × 2.50 = 2.662 k; (6) 1.105 × 0.80 + 0.75 × 0.80 + 0.525 × 2.50 = 2.796 k; D + L = 1.600 k → C = 2.796 k — combination (6) with live load governs."
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "text": "Gaps: the full-line load over 14 ft (8–16 and 24–30) has no wall, beam or post below → D 1.40 k and L 2.80 k are not carried (two audit notes)."
    },
    {
      "step": 6,
      "text": "Post P-5 (x = 12, 10 ft): D 3 k, L 1.5 k. ASD: D + L = 4.500 k; (6) 1.105 × 3 + 0.75 × 1.5 = 4.440 k; (5) = 3.420 k; the Ω₀ combinations have no E on the post (same values) → C = 4.500 k. Base T = 0 → HDUE3 (lightest), minimum post (2)2x4 → (2)2x4 (cap 5.00 k)."
    },
    {
      "step": 7,
      "text": "G8 1.0D balance: applied = wall self-weight 2 × 0.80 + line load 100 × 30 / 1000 + point 3 = 7.60 k; foundation = 2 × 1.60 + 3 = 6.20 k; excluded = 1.40 k → 6.20 + 1.40 = 7.60 k, balanced → G1–G12 pass."
    },
    {
      "step": 8,
      "text": "SW-9 (Eq. 4.3-1, → governs): v = 1000 × 2.000 / 8 = 250.00 plf, A = 10.5 in², G_a = 16 k/in → 8vh³/(EAb) = 0.0140; vh/(1000G_a) = 0.1563; uplift end T = 2500.00 lb (lateral); Δ_HD = δ_LRFD × T / T_LRFD = 0.178 × 2500.00 / 5306 = 0.0839 (HDUE3); r = 2500.00 / (10.5 × 625) = 0.3810 → Δ_c = 0.0104; h·Δa/b = 10 × (0.0839 + 0.0104) / 8 = 0.1179 → δ = 0.2881 in. SW-10 is identical (same length, share and pinned design) → equal δ; the first listed governs."
    },
    {
      "step": 9,
      "text": "Story drift Level 1: δxe = the largest wall δ = SW-9 0.2881 in → δx = Cd·δxe/Ie = 4 × 0.2881 / 1.0 = 1.153 in vs Δa = 0.020 × 10 × 12 = 2.400 in → OK."
    }
  ],
